<%- include('partials/header') %>

<div class="page-head prose">
  <h1>Find accessibility services you can trust</h1>
  <p class="lead">
    Interpreters, accessible transport, caregivers and mobility assistance — from providers
    verified before they appear here. Book in one place and follow every request from
    submission to completion.
  </p>
  <p class="cluster">
    <a class="btn btn--primary" href="/services">
      <svg class="icon" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><use href="#icon-search"></use></svg>
      Browse services
    </a>
    <% if (!user) { %>
      <a class="btn btn--secondary" href="/register">Create an account</a>
    <% } %>
  </p>
</div>

<h2>How a booking works</h2>
<ol class="stack prose">
  <li>
    <strong>Search verified listings.</strong> Filter by category, location, price and
    availability. Only providers an administrator has approved are ever listed.
  </li>
  <li>
    <strong>Send a request.</strong> Choose a date and time and add anything the provider
    needs to know about your access requirements.
  </li>
  <li>
    <strong>Track it.</strong> Every change of status is recorded, so you can see exactly
    where a request stands and when it changed.
  </li>
  <li>
    <strong>Get in-person support if you need it.</strong> A coordinator can assign a
    volunteer assistant to a confirmed booking.
  </li>
</ol>

<%- include('partials/footer') %>
